{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17420","headline":"赠文敬太子挽歌词二首 二 · 权德舆","name":"赠文敬太子挽歌词二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"铜壶晓漏初，羽翣拥涂车。\n方外留鸿宝，人间得善书。\n清笳悲画绶，朱邸散长裾。\n还似缑山驾，飘飘向碧虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}